        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Fragment of tapestry woven wool and silk, Flanders, ca. 1700"@en , "Tapestry fragment of wool and silk. On a pale brown ground a blue flower springs from a large red acanthus leaf, top right, and part of a bunch of red, white and blue flowers is seen lower left. At the bottom right corner is a woven patch set in over the existing tapestry."@en ;
